project HelloViaCPrintf
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1

entry console main

error MainError
errorCase MainError ConsoleWriteFailed CSignedInt32

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
memory main stack max 4KiB
async main no

purpose operation main "Smoke-test the c.printf call target end-to-end through the SemanticScript LLVM backend"
invariant operation main "A single c.printf call writes the greeting plus a newline and returns the byte count"

label startMain

storage module immutable helloFormatText CNullTerminatedByteString "Hello from c.printf! arg=%d\n"
storage module immutable greetingArgument CSignedInt32 42

call helloPrintfCall c.printf
argument helloPrintfCall format CNullTerminatedByteString helloFormatText
argument helloPrintfCall value CSignedInt32 greetingArgument
run helloPrintfCall
bind ok bytesWrittenByPrintf CSignedInt32 helloPrintfCall
bind error helloPrintfError CSignedInt32 helloPrintfCall
branch error source helloPrintfCall target helloPrintfFailed

storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode

label helloPrintfFailed
makeError helloPrintfFailure MainError.ConsoleWriteFailed helloPrintfError
return error helloPrintfFailure
